   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">People explore the wind farm in Sicily, surrounded by green hills and blue skies. The sun shines on the landscape, creating a vibrant atmosphere and showcasing Italy's natural beauty.</rdf:li>
